WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.000
First Generation Operation

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Collect the sample, add lysis buffer,

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
perform high-temperature lysis using an external water bath,

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
and transfer the extract to a reaction tube.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Add the sample and RPA reaction mixture
to the bottom of the tube.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Place Cas12a, gRNA, and the fluorescent reporter
in the tube cap.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Incubate the tube at 37°C for 20 minutes.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
RPA amplification occurs at the bottom

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
while the components in the cap form a complex.

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Centrifuge the tube to bring the liquid in the cap
into the bottom of the tube.

11
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Heat at 43°C and monitor the fluorescence signal in real time.

12
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Capture an image, locate the reaction tube,

13
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.000
analyze its fluorescence, and display the result in the app.

